Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 4.4.86-rt99 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 4.4.86 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v4.4-rt
  Head SHA1: 75c0749b8b72c3c5a7bed1640fb67f40d0443c13


Or to build 4.4.86-rt99 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/linux-4.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/patch-4.4.86.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/4.4/patch-4.4.86-rt99.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
